sequenceDiagram
  participant Runner
  participant UI as Profile UI
  participant Gateway
  participant Garmin
  participant Queue as Durable outbox

  Runner->>UI: Connect Garmin
  UI->>Gateway: Start profile-bound OAuth
  Gateway->>Gateway: Hash state, protect PKCE verifier
  Gateway-->>Runner: Redirect to Garmin consent
  Garmin-->>Gateway: Authorization code + state
  Gateway->>Gateway: Consume state once, exchange code, protect tokens
  Gateway->>Queue: Enqueue current workouts, plans, calendar
  Queue->>Garmin: Publish with idempotency key
  Garmin-->>Queue: Remote identifier
  Queue-->>UI: Synced status
